{"articleNo":"107056","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=107056&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"지속성장학생(성적우수) 간담회 개최 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.05.29","hit":"4624","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">지속성장학생</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">성적우수</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">간담회 개최 안내</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">발전기금 수석입학장학생 및 한국장학재단 국가이공계장학생</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">교내 최우수장학생을 대상으로 하는 간담회를 다음과 같이 개최하고자 합니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">해당 장학생들은 빠짐없이 참석하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><strong><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">※ </span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">참석자 장학생에게 문자 통보 하였습니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; COLOR: #ff0000; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">■ </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">일시 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2014. 5. 29(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">목</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) 18</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230\">시</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-farea